  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The arrangement of X<sup>-</sup> ions around A<sup>+</sup> ion in solid AX is given in the figure (not drawn to scale). If the radius of X<sup>-</sup> is 250 pm, the radius of A<sup>+</sup> is <br ><img src=\"assets\\qt0009_d2efc4c455d1.jpg\"/></p>"
